  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/565956/description_f5f4eb05-277d-4a00-9321-93a838b0c80d.png\" alt=\"TerraBlender 標誌\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/565956/description_75d4a742-27a8-4a7c-b7f6-6be6259b0af8.png\" alt=\"Glitchfiend 標誌\" width=\"165\" height=\"34\"> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/565956/description_a9dbfc09-89b3-4f6a-8eb1-b86556dca5cf.png\" alt=\"Fabric API 標誌\" width=\"104\" height=\"35\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/GyyzU6T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/565956/description_36bbee00-3841-4fe2-baa6-49f6ea9e3894.png\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\" width=\"212\" height=\"38\"></a></p>\n<h1>說明</h1>\n<hr>\n<h4>TerraBlender 是一款程式庫模組，旨在以簡便且相容的方式，搭配 Minecraft 的新生物群系／地形系統來新增生物群系。</h4>\n<p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>開發者</h1>\n<hr>\n<h3>有關如何使用 TerraBlender API 的文件可於 <a href=\"https://github.com/Glitchfiend/TerraBlender/wiki/Getting-started\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender wiki</a> 查閱</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>相關連結</h1>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/TheAdubbz\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Twitter 上追蹤我</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.paypal.com/donate/?business=AdubbzG@gmail.com&item_name=TerraBlender (from CurseForge.com)&cy_code=USD\" rel=\"nofollow\">使用 PayPal 贊助</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Adubbz\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Patreon 上支持我</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>其他模組載入器版本</h1>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender (Forge 版)</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender (NeoForge 版)</a></strong></li>\n</ul>",
